{"name":"Thorny Brush","hex":"#7f716a","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"thorny","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having thorns or spines.","Troublesome or vexatious."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/thorny"},{"term":"brush","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An implement consisting of multiple more or less flexible bristles or other filaments attached to a handle, used for any of various purposes including cleaning, painting, and arranging hair.","The act of brushing something."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To clean with a brush.","To untangle or arrange with a brush."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/brush"}],"entries":[{"title":"Brush","blocks":[{"text":"A brush is a common tool with bristles, wire, or other filaments. It generally comprises a handle or block to which filaments are affixed in either a parallel or perpendicular orientation, depending on the way the brush is to be gripped during use. The material of both the block and bristles or filaments is chosen to withstand hazards of its intended use, such as corrosive chemicals, heat, or abrasion. It is used for cleaning, grooming hair, makeup, painting, surface finishing, and many other purposes. It is one of the most basic and versatile tools in use today, and the average household may contain several dozen varieties."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/BurglaryIsrael2.jpg/330px-BurglaryIsrael2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brush"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Makeup_weapons_Brushes_.jpg/500px-Makeup_weapons_Brushes_.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Makeup_weapons_Brushes_.jpg/1280px-Makeup_weapons_Brushes_.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Makeup_weapons_Brushes_.jpg/500px-Makeup_weapons_Brushes_.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Assorted cosmetics and Makeup brushes","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMakeup_weapons_Brushes_.jpg"}],"sounds":{"thorny":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fe/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-thorny.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fe/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-thorny.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-thorny.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fe/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-thorny.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-thorny.wav.ogg"}],"brush":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/En-us-brush.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3f/En-us-brush.ogg/En-us-brush.ogg.mp3"}]}}}